Prefer files under `workflows/`, `schemas/`, and `examples/`. Community Edition has no billing/paywall. See `docs/LICENSE_STRATEGY.md` for Community vs Pro boundaries.

## Research tooling

If web/search tools are unavailable or return nothing attributable, **disclose the limitation**, refuse to invent companies/contacts/URLs, and provide an alternative research plan. Never claim research was completed without sources.

## When blocked

Say what is blocked, what input would unblock it, and stop inventing. Prefer actionable next steps over filler.
